  DbOnly --> AdminChat["Admin runs agent at /user/<user-id>"]
  AdminChat --> Collect[Onboarding via chat widgets]
  Collect --> Enrich[Sequential Firecrawl jobs + progress %]
  Enrich --> Gen[Generate 2 distinct variants]
  Gen --> Pick[Inline preview + select variant]
  Pick --> Decision{Approve or Edit?}
  Decision -->|Approve| Deploy["Publish /lp/<websiteId>"]
  Decision -->|Edit| EditWidget[Agent widget: edit categories]
  EditWidget --> InlineEdit[Pencil + inline editor]
  InlineEdit --> PreviewReturn[Return to inline preview]
