## Phase plan

### Phase 0 — Foundation (prerequisite)

- Apply existing `plan_inquiries` migration + all new migrations in Lovable.
- Enable Lovable email-OTP + Custom Emails + install `@lovable.dev/email-js`.
- Add env vars: `LOVABLE_API_KEY`, `FIRECRAWL_API_KEY`, `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`. Lovable configures GPT-5.5 access.
- Add UI component index: [`ui-components/manifest.json`](ui-components/manifest.json) in repo; block archives in Lovable Cloud storage bucket `ui-components`.
- Define agent system prompts, tool registry, journal artifact pattern (`journal-<license-number>.md` in `journals/` bucket).
- Spike: background job runner (chain schema, Cloudflare worker) + Realtime progress; GPT-5.5 streaming via Lovable AI.

### Phase 1 — Admin kickoff + OTP auth + user workspace shell

**Ships:** `/admin` kickoff (DB-only profile), `adminImpersonateUser`, post-checkout flow (`completePostCheckout` + `verifyOtpAndLinkProfile` + `simulatePostCheckout` stub), `/login` OTP auth, `/user/<profiles.id>` shell (chat + preview panels), `background_jobs` runner with Realtime progress.

**Exit criteria:** admin can kickoff by license → impersonate → land on `/user/<profiles.id>`; admin can simulate subscription → contractor completes OTP → OTP-login reaches same workspace.

### Phase 2 — Agent onboarding chat

**Ships:** full chat UI (streaming, markdown, rich text, scroll, mobile layout, inline widgets), onboarding collection, journal every 10 messages, conversation persistence.

**Exit criteria:** all required fields collected; journal artifact written; conversation replayable in admin.

### Phase 3 — Enrichment + dual generation + inline preview/approve

**Ships:** sequential Firecrawl jobs (CA-only, deep search, `no_results_found`), component-library site gen (persona-first), 2 distinct variants, inline preview in `/user/<id>`, variant selection + Previous designs history, approve → `/lp/:id`.

**Exit criteria:** admin kickoff → live public URL; discarded variants in history.

### Phase 4 — Edit categories + leads + admin records

**Ships:** agent-widget edit categories, pencil inline editors, return-to-preview flow, `/lp` lead capture to DB, full admin records (users, sites, conversations, edits, leads).

**Exit criteria:** edit flow complete; leads visible in admin scoped by license/LP.

