| **2 — Auth & admin entry** | Operator login, kickoff, impersonation, contractor OTP | `/admin` login + kickoff UI; `adminKickoff`, `adminLogin`, `adminImpersonateUser`; `/login` OTP flow (`sendOtp`, `verifyOtp`); post-checkout server fns (`completePostCheckout`, `verifyOtpAndLinkProfile`, `simulatePostCheckout`); OTP verification page | Phase 1 (auth half) |
| **3 — Workspace shell & job runner** | `/user` layout, background jobs, Realtime progress | `/user/$userId` route shell (chat panel + preview panel placeholders); `background_jobs` Cloudflare runner (claim, execute, retry); Supabase Realtime subscription for job progress; `getJobProgress` fallback; `firecrawl_scrape` + `generateSiteVariants` enqueue only | Phase 1 (shell + jobs) |
| **4 — Agent chat, enrichment & generation** | Full chat UX, journal, Firecrawl chains, variants, preview, publish | `sendAgentMessage` SSE streaming; chat UI (markdown, widgets, mobile, tool-status bubbles); onboarding field collection + `saveOnboardingField`; journal write every 10 msgs to Storage; enrichment job handlers (Firecrawl per platform, `research_status` mirror); `site_generation` handler → 2 variants; inline preview + variant selection + Previous designs; `approveWebsiteVersion` + `publishToLp` → `/lp/$websiteId` + `site-renderer` | Phase 2 + Phase 3 |
| **5 — Edit flow, leads & admin records** | 6-category edits, LP leads, admin dashboard completeness | Agent-widget edit categories + pencil inline editors; `applyWebsiteEdits` + `applyConfigPatch`; `/lp` lead form + `submitLead`; admin screens (users, websites, conversations, edits, leads, job chains); media upload validation (G1/G10 formats) | Phase 4 |

