1. Migrations apply cleanly in Lovable; types generated.
2. Admin can kickoff → impersonate → reach `/user/<profiles.id>`; simulate subscription → OTP → login works.
3. Job chain enqueues and Realtime progress renders in workspace shell.
4. Admin kickoff → onboarding → enrichment → 2 variants → approve → live `/lp/:id`.
5. Edit flow works; leads appear in admin; all admin list screens paginate.

