## Edge cases & failure modes (cross-cutting)

| Scenario | Behavior |
|---|---|
| Checkout / payment UI | **Deferred** — LP enquiry flow unchanged; post-checkout flow tested via `simulatePostCheckout` |
| License not found at login | “Subscribe to get started.” |
| License found but `auth_user_id` null | “Complete subscription to activate account.” |
| License already activated, new checkout with different email | Reject at `completePostCheckout`: “License already activated — log in instead.” |
| OTP expired / invalid | Retry with rate limit; no password fallback |
| Session expiry | `/login` → license/email → OTP |
| Scraping finds nothing | `research_status=no_results_found` on both `contractor_profiles` and `websites`; no hallucinated fill |
| Scraping partial | `research_status=partial`; agent explains gaps |
| Agent cites missing data | Omit or neutral copy; never invent |
| Two variants too similar | Regenerate with forced orthogonal layout (persona-first prompt) |
| Unselected variant | Saved as `discarded` in history; accessible via Previous designs |
| User switches variant after selection | Via Previous designs → re-approve required for live `/lp` |
| Primary color skipped | Agent assigns default; stored in `onboarding_state` |
| User idle mid-chat | Persist state; resume on OTP login |
| Edit categories changed mid-session | Lock/unlock pencil icons accordingly |
| After edits | Return to inline preview before approve |
| Media upload | **Images:** png, jpg, jpeg, webp, hevc. **Video:** mp4, gif. Same for chat, media edit, gallery. Reject others. Mobile playback for mp4/gif. |
| Lead form submit on `/lp` | → `leads` table scoped by website_id + license_number + profiles.id |
| Admin hardcoded creds leaked | Rotate via env; never commit `Batman@123` |
| Migration not applied | All DB features fail — apply each migration in Lovable (per `cursor.md`) |
| `/lp/:id` on non-live site | 404 unless owner preview token |

